---
import GifFooter from './GifFooter.astro';
---

<footer id="about">

  <!-- Footer columns -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8" style="padding: 88px 20px 8px; line-height: 0.65;">

    <div class="reveal" style="--i: 0;">
      <h2 class="lang-en font-geist text-[28px] font-bold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-6">Studio</h2>
      <h2 class="lang-es font-geist text-[28px] font-bold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-6">Estudio</h2>
      <div class="max-w-sm">
        <p class="lang-en text-xs text-[var(--color-muted)]">Manol is an independent design studio based in Buenos Aires, working worldwide. Its work spans brand identities, motion systems, posters, album covers and music videos, and leans toward design that leaves the screen: things that get printed, projected, played, held. Each project is built with the people it needs: illustrators, designers, animators, printers, musicians.</p>
        <p class="lang-es text-xs text-[var(--color-muted)]">Manol es un estudio de diseño independiente de Buenos Aires que trabaja para cualquier parte del mundo. Su trabajo va de las identidades de marca y los sistemas de motion a los afiches, las tapas de disco y los videoclips, y le interesa sobre todo el diseño que sale de la pantalla: lo que se imprime, se proyecta, se escucha, se toca. Cada proyecto se arma con los perfiles que requiera: ilustradores, diseñadores, animadores, impresores, músicos.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal" style="--i: 1;">
      <div class="lang-en">
        <h2 class="font-geist text-[28px] font-bold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-6">Services</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          {['Brand identities', 'Motion & animated systems', 'Album covers and visual art', 'Posters and graphic pieces', 'Music videos and audiovisual work'].map(s => (
            <li class="text-xs text-[var(--color-muted)]">{s}</li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="lang-es">
        <h2 class="font-geist text-[28px] font-bold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-6">Servicios</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          {['Identidades de marca', 'Motion & sistemas animados', 'Tapas de discos y arte visual', 'Posters y piezas gráficas', 'Videoclips y piezas audiovisuales'].map(s => (
            <li class="text-xs text-[var(--color-muted)]">{s}</li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal" style="--i: 2;">
      <h2 class="lang-en font-geist text-[28px] font-bold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-6">Worked with</h2>
      <h2 class="lang-es font-geist text-[28px] font-bold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-6">Trabajó con</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        {[
          { name: 'Paisanos',  url: 'https://www.paisanos.io/es' },
          { name: 'Rampant',   url: 'https://www.rampant.work/' },
          { name: 'Paradigma', url: 'https://paradigma.cc/' },
          { name: 'Aerolab',   url: 'https://aerolab.co/' },
          { name: 'Almanach',  url: 'https://almanach.work/' },
          { name: 'Joyco',     url: 'https://joyco.studio/' },
        ].map(p => (
          <li>
            <a
              href={p.url}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text-xs text-[var(--color-muted)] hover:text-[var(--color-text)] transition-colors"
            >
              {p.name}
            </a>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal" style="--i: 3;">
      <div class="lang-en">
        <h2 class="font-geist text-[28px] font-bold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-6">Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-muted)] mb-3">If you're working on something and think we could make something good together, reach out.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lang-es">
        <h2 class="font-geist text-[28px] font-bold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-6">Contacto</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-muted)] mb-3">Si estás trabajando en algo y creés que podemos hacer algo bueno juntos, escribime.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[var(--color-muted)]">Manu Bedacarratz</p>
      <a
        href="mailto:hola@manol-studio.com"
        class="block mt-2 text-xs text-[var(--color-muted)] hover:text-[var(--color-text)] transition-colors"
      >
        hola@manol-studio.com
      </a>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-4" style="margin-top: 16px;">
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/___manol___/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--color-muted)] hover:text-[var(--color-text)] transition-colors">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5"/>
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/>
            <circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="0.8" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="https://vimeo.com/manuellbedacarratz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--color-muted)] hover:text-[var(--color-text)] transition-colors">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
            <path d="M22 7.42c-.09 2.09-1.55 4.95-4.39 8.58C14.68 19.8 12.2 21.6 10.12 21.6c-1.29 0-2.38-1.19-3.26-3.57L5.3 12.18C4.6 9.8 3.83 8.6 3.02 8.6c-.18 0-.8.38-1.86 1.13L0 8.32c1.17-1.03 2.33-2.06 3.47-3.09C5.1 3.8 6.32 3.11 7.15 3.04c2.02-.19 3.26 1.19 3.73 4.13.5 3.17.85 5.14 1.06 5.92.59 2.67 1.23 4 1.93 4 .54 0 1.37-.86 2.47-2.58 1.1-1.72 1.69-3.03 1.77-3.93.16-1.48-.43-2.22-1.77-2.22-.63 0-1.28.14-1.95.44 1.3-4.24 3.77-6.3 7.43-6.17C23.97 2.7 22.13 4.83 22 7.42z"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/manuel-bedacarratz/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--color-muted)] hover:text-[var(--color-text)] transition-colors">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
            <path d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"/>
            <rect x="2" y="9" width="4" height="12"/>
            <circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <GifFooter marginBottom="-90px" />
  </div>

</footer>
